      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Quick optimizations: first, in the inner loop, iterate `j` only up to `sqrt(i) + 1` instead of all the way to `i` — judging by a factor of `i` greater than its square root is redundant. Second, skip even numbers entirely after handling 2 (e.g., `range(3, n, 2)`) to cut the work in half. Optionally, a simple sieve if you're up for a small rewrite, but the two fixes above are the biggest wins with minimal code change.",
